   "strokeColor": "#94a3b8",
   "text": "prototype: reads a fabricated definition the way a harness would, classifies six fabricated shell commands as reads or writes — never\nrunning them — and sets the file the role must write beside the sentence that it changes nothing; --narrowed adds the frontmatter\nline that fixes the grant and leaves the shell. No model, no review and no shell.",
